<h3>The Age</h3>
<p>Keith wrote for <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Age" target"_self">The Age</a> occasionally from 1986 until his death. Collections of his columns for The Age can be found in his books "No Brains on Tuesday" and "A Day in the Life of Australia".</p>
